Package: kali-ai-native-agents
Version: 0.1.0
Section: metapackages
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: kali-ai-native-core, python3-httpx
Maintainer: AI-native Kali project <maintainer@example.invalid>
Description: AI-native Kali - CrewAI agent runtime and Kanban bridge
 Installs the agent runtime: the Kanban <-> CrewAI bridge, the crew and role
 definitions, and the human-in-the-loop approval gate. Cards in the Assigned
 column are claimed by crews, executed through the guardrailed tool layer,
 and released to Review with traces and artifacts attached.
